    "statement": "For the canonical one-antipodal root cells, weight cell i by lambda_i=1/Phi'(w_i). The resulting negation difference has zero Fourier moments through degree 3H-1 and first syndrome -2H at degree 3H. Its support is therefore at least 3H+1=3R+4; at equality its values are exactly -2H/Psi'(a) on a negation-stable support. This does not classify or exclude the remaining supports.",
